  "sdo:name": "Training-through-Research (Floating University)",
  "sdo:description": "Training-through-Research (Floating University) is an international multi-disciplinary programme aimed at combining formal academic education with deep involvement of students and early career scientists into real-life scientific investigations in the Ocean, including research cruises and post-expedition processing of the collected field data within international academic communities. Future generations of marine scientists are learning under the supervision of world-class experts and build knowledge in  interdisciplinary studies of complex systems, discovering relationships of hydrosphere, atmosphere, geosphere, and biosphere.",
